# Files no project builds, tests or reads. Nx leaves them out of the graph, so
# editing them affects no project; the root project (terminal-approval) would
# otherwise own them and rerun the crate's suites for a notes or dev-environment
# change. README.md and LICENSE are not here: the crate packages them. Anything a
# target reads must never be listed.
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
/CHANGELOG.md
# Agent, hook, judged-lint and secrets-sync settings: read by those tools, never
# by an Nx target.
/.claude/
/lefthook.yml
/llmlint.yml
/oneharness.toml
/gh-secrets.json
